coord=\"32352,31060,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32352, 31060, 7)</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights until death, follows you. Damaging him makes him say \"Grrrr! Kisavuta!\" and triggers his AoE life drain attack.<br/><br/>Attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tSpawns together with large group of other <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoyas\">Chakoyas</a>. There are 5 waves in total, each 5 seconds apart. The first 4 waves contain Chakoyas, and on the 5th wave Ocyakao spawns (20 seconds after the first wave). It is advisable to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Thunderstorm%20Rune\">Thunderstorm Runes</a> to get rid of his minions, or invisibility to hide from them. Comparable to an <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leader</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 15 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\"><img alt=\"Fish\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>4-9</td>\n<td>6.4</td>\n<td class=